        "mds:value": "photo camera (UVF imaging)",
        "mds:quote": "Both detection options operate in three spectral ranges (red, green, and blue), according to the physiology of the human eye that the camera emulates."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Crack": {
        "mds:value": "cell cracks",
        "mds:quote": "The method allows for detection of cell cracks in a chronological order of occurrence,"
      },
