        "mds:value": "photovoltaic (PV) modules; crystalline silicon photovoltaic (PV) module",
        "mds:quote": "Ultraviolet fluorescence is used to identify defects in wafer-based crystalline silicon photovoltaic (PV) modules."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/DefectDetectionMethod": {
        "mds:value": "UVF; UV fluorescence; ultraviolet ﬂuorescence method",
