        "mds:value": "polymeric encapsulant, UV A transparent EV A, UV A absorbing EV A",
        "mds:quote": "Fig. 10. Fluorescence pattern of naturally aged (∼5 years) modules with identical service life and site of installation but two backsheet types: left: Polyamid with high OTR, right: Tedlar with low OTR [16]."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/EnvironmentalCondition": {
        "mds:value": "temperature (27° C / 57° C), humidity (50% r.H.), irradiation dose up to 890 kWh/m², wavelength range (380 - 700 nm)",
        "mds:quote": "The integrated transmission loss in the wavelength range 380 to 700 nm of three different EV A materials exposed to artificial UV doses of up to 890 kWh/m² at a temperature of 27 or 57 °C was measured."
      },
