        "mds:value": "90% r.H.",
        "mds:quote": "Increasing the stress load to 90 °C and 90% r.H. (DH90) gives an even more distinct pattern of strong UVF between the cells and over the edges of the solar cells while keeping an area with less UVF over the center of the cells."
      },
